{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">薄扶林碧瑤灣發生斬人案。網上流傳影片，片中所見，一位赤膊男子持刀追着保安施襲，其中一保安不慎跌倒，該男子欲上前施襲，保安踢腳防衛。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-10-11h17m18s817.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026bnTwSNPcVO1786332948.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-10-11h17m18s817.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">今早（10日）上午9時24分，警方接獲報案，指域多利道550號碧瑤灣一名男子揮刀斬人，一名女傭和一名男保安員受傷，女傭頸部、背部受傷，男保安員則手部擦傷。衝鋒隊及快速應變部隊等警員隨即穿上防刺背心趕抵現場，並當場拘捕涉案男疑犯。案件暫列「傷人」，警方正調查涉案動機。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-10-11h17m35s095.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026aoFnxuVIvp1786332965.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-10-11h17m35s095.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T03:59:00.173252+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}